{"id": "SEG_S0405_R000063_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000412_R000063_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:7e158b958076e3b95f7237da21381c5b2a815637e712b22eb879c5a536cdba83", "file_id": "S0405", "scene_id": "SCN0396", "order": 24, "speaker": null, "translation": "Сэмбэй, покрытые той самой неописуемо насыщенной сладко-солёной пудрой.", "status": "draft", "flags": ["needs_term_decision"], "confidence": "medium"}
