{"id": "SEG_S0405_R000164_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000412_R000164_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:f77fd513b3314430e6b6604384497b7a49bb8af9ada4feb870e82867e7453065", "file_id": "S0405", "scene_id": "SCN0396", "order": 66, "speaker": "良一", "translation": "Всё-таки идёт…", "status": "draft", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0405_R000169_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000412_R000169_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:72ceb9420cd22ddacec07617398c8888836ad10562509a8132dd58f5bde434a2", "file_id": "S0405", "scene_id": "SCN0396", "order": 67, "speaker": null, "translation": "Бах! Дверь с силой распахивается.", "status": "draft", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
